# Not published, and not only mine to publish.
#
# _private/ holds the things that must not reach a public GitHub Pages site:
# the trained force model, the reference fixture, and unpublished reviews --
# including a student's thesis results, which are his to publish first. The app
# degrades deliberately when they are absent (see loadForceModel, ?demo=1) so
# that a checkout without them still runs.
#
# Anything the browser can fetch from the deployed site is public, whatever
# this file says: that is a property of static hosting, not of the repo.
_private/
data/review/
data/reference.json
data/force_model.json
